<title>POLAND: Mostostal-W wins PLN 22.5 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Mostostal-W wins PLN 22.5 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction company Mostostal Warszawa SA has won a tender for repairing a bridge and building tram tunnels in Warsaw, worth about 22.5 million zlotys, the company said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Mostostal said the works would be carried out by the end of 1998.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
